SUMMARY:IMPROV and ACTING IN THE PARK!  (with Dinner Party after)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\n**Hello everyone\,**
 \n\nPlease join us for our a great afternoon with **IMPROV and ACTING in t
 he PARK!**\n\nIt's a blast! (and no experience required\; just a willingne
 ss to have fun\, not take ourselves too seriously and laugh a lot!\n\n\\*J
 oined by my other groups too\; so we can anticipate a great afternoon\n\nE
 vent details below:\n\nSincerely\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\nmeet
 up.com/soulcity\n\nEvent Details:\n\n**IMPROV and ACTING in the PARK! (Mee
 t at Yonge & Lawrence Corner)**\n(Dinner Party after)\n\nThis is a well or
 ganized event filled with Improv\, skits\, sketch comedy and of course lot
 s of hilarious scenes.\n\n-A fun afternoon for all Improv enthusiasts and 
 newbies of Improv!\n\n\\*No experience required\; just an open mind and a 
 desire to meet some wonderful people\, laugh and have fun!\n\n\\*Bring a B
 lanket or a Lawn Chair if you like :) (optional)\n\n**Event Fee:** 10 doll
 ars (Cash only) (HST is included)\nor e transfer to steveflemming11@gmail.
 com\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\
 n**Location and Meeting Spot:**\n\n\\*We will meet outside the **Toronto L
 ocke Library (3083 Yonge Street)** then walk 1 minute south to the Lawrenc
 e Park. (South East Corner of Yonge and Lawrence)\n\n**(Right beside Subwa
 y line\, and plenty of Free Street Parking along Lawrence)**\n\n**-Arrive 
 at 3:00 PM\, we will head down to park together around 3:30**\n-If arrivin
 g late you will see us down at the park- but do your best to come on time 
 :)\n(The park is one block south of Lawrence\, on East side of Yonge)\n\\-
 \\-\\-
