SUMMARY:The Sunday Night Cocktails and Conversations Social!
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nGood day everyone\,\
 n\nLooking for a fun and relaxed way to finish your weekend? Join us for *
 *The Sunday Night Cocktails and Conversations Social!** —an easygoing ev
 ening filled with friendly people\, refreshing drinks\, laughter and engag
 ing conversation. Whether you come with friends or arrive on your own\, th
 e atmosphere will make it easy to mingle\, connect and enjoy a great Sunda
 y night together.\n\n\\*Joined by my other social groups too\; so we can a
 nticipate a fabulous turn out with lots of friendly peers to begin our wee
 kend with!\n\n\\*Please note we are at **The Pheasant: A Firkin Pub** at 1
 999 Avenue Road (roughly 6 blocks north of Lawrence - south of the 401 **(
 we will be in the back dining area)**\n\n*\\*You can ask the bartender if 
 you like to show you to the group (simply ask for Steve's dinner party)*\n
 \n-You'll find it's a cozy\, relaxed and enjoyable atmosphere!\n\n**-Free 
 Parking found on residential side streets**\n\n(Event Details Below)\n\nSi
 ncerely\,\n\nSteve Flemming\n(Organizer/Host)\n\nEvent Details:\n**The Sun
 day Night Cocktails and Conversations Social!**\n\n**Highlights**\n\n* Mee
 t friendly and interesting people locally and internationally\n* Enjoy coc
 ktails\, casual conversation and plenty of laughter\n* Mingle naturally wi
 thout structured activities or unnecessary pressure\n* Reconnect with fami
 liar faces while making some new friends\n* Relax\, socialize and finish y
 our weekend on a positive note\n\n**Conversation Topics** may include but 
 not limited too: Travel\, Culture\, Spirituality\, Relationships\, Modern 
 Dating\, Work/Life balance\, Life after Marriage\, Dating Apps\, Comedy\, 
 History\, Art\, Technology\, Economy\, Music\, Movies\, Sports\, Fashion\,
  Hobbies\, Books\, Psychology\, Philosophy\, the Future\, History\, Pop Cu
 lture\, Theatre\, etc.)\n\nHosted by Steve Flemming\n\n**Event Fee:** 5 do
 llars (Cash only at the door) (HST included)\nor by e transfer: **stevefle
 mming11@gmail.com**\n\\*No extra charge for those attending the 4 pm walk 
 :)\n\n***\n\n**Friendly Reminders:**\n\n-Arrive any time between 7:30 pm a
 nd 8:30 pm (if you can) (please ask for Steve when you arrive- we will eit
 her be inside or on the patio-depending on weather and our numbers)\n\n\\*
 Great dinner menu and food specials provided:\n(One beverage or appetizer 
 minimum upon arrival to support venue)\n\n**Parking and Transportation:**\
 n\\*Lots of street parking on avenue and free residential parking\nhttps:/
 /www.firkinpubs.com/thepheasantandfirkin/\n\n(15-20 minute walk from Yonge
  & Lawrence subway station-or simply take bus or uber from the station)
