SUMMARY:Is AI and Technology Helping Us Live- or Replacing Living? (Meanin
 gful Events)
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n
 ㅤ\n\\*Joined by my other groups too :)\nㅤ\n\\*We prefer that you turn 
 your cameras on so we can feel more connected with each other.\nㅤ\n**Eve
 nt Details:**\nㅤ\n**Is AI and Technology Helping Us Live—or Replacing 
 Living?**\nㅤ\nAI and technology are changing our lives at an extraordina
 ry pace. They can save us time\, expand our creativity\, connect us with t
 he world and make things possible that would have seemed unimaginable only
  a few years ago.\nㅤ\nBut there is another question worth asking:\nㅤ\n
 Are these technologies helping us live more fully—or are they gradually 
 replacing some of the very experiences that make us feel alive?\nㅤ\nJoin
  us on Zoom for an open\, thoughtful and friendly conversation about how w
 e can embrace AI and modern technology while remaining free\, healthy\, cr
 eative\, connected\, joyful and engaged with the real world.\nㅤ\nThis is
 n't an anti-technology discussion. It's about finding a healthy relationsh
 ip with technology—using it to expand our lives rather than allowing it 
 to quietly take them over.\nㅤ\nEveryone is welcome to share their though
 ts and experiences. You don't need to know anything about AI or technology
  to participate.\nㅤ\nMore details below.\nㅤ\nSincerely\,\nㅤ\nSteve F
 lemming\n(Canadian Folk\, Country and Adult Contemporary Artist)\nㅤ\nㅤ
 \n**Is AI and Technology Helping Us Live—or Replacing Living?**\nㅤ\n
 🕗 8:15 PM – 9:30 PM\n💻 Online via Zoom\nㅤ\n**Highlights of Our T
 alk**\nㅤ\n• How can we enjoy the incredible benefits of AI and technol
 ogy without becoming overly dependent on them or allowing convenience to m
 ake us passive?\nㅤ\n• How do we protect real-world friendships\, human
  connection\, physical activity and time away from screens in an increasin
 gly digital world?\nㅤ\n• Why might silence\, boredom\, reflection and 
 doing difficult things ourselves still be essential for creativity\, indep
 endence and peace of mind?\nㅤ\n• As technology gives us more convenien
 ce and more free time\, how do we make sure we're using that freedom to cr
 eate\, love\, connect\, explore and actually live?\nㅤ\nThis will be a co
 nversation rather than a lecture. Bring your experiences\, questions\, con
 cerns\, optimism and different points of view.\nㅤ\nPerhaps the most usef
 ul question we can take away from the evening is one we can ask ourselves 
 whenever a new technology enters our lives:\nㅤ\n“Is this helping me li
 ve—or replacing living?”\nㅤ\nCome join us\, meet some new people and
  be part of the conversation.\nㅤ\nㅤ\n**Arrival Time:**\nㅤ\nPlease jo
 in us on time at 8:15 PM if you can.\nㅤ\nㅤ\n**Hosted by Steve Flemming
  — Soul City Social Club**\nmeetup.com/soulcity\nㅤ\nㅤ\n**Event Suppo
 rt:**\nㅤ\nHelp support these meaningful online events hosted by Steve Fl
 emming.\nㅤ\nIf you wish to support these Thursday night online events\, 
 which are followed by more than three hours of music that I have written a
 nd produced\, you can make a contribution by e-transfer or PayPal to:\nㅤ
 \n[steveflemming11@gmail.com](mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.com)\nㅤ\nA su
 ggested contribution of $5–$10 is appreciated for the event.\nㅤ\nYou c
 an also make a monthly contribution\, with a suggested amount of $15–$20
  per month for all my online events.\nㅤ\nAnything you can contribute is 
 greatly appreciated and helps support these meaningful online events.\nㅤ
 \nThanks again\, everyone!\nㅤ\nㅤ\n**Zoom link:**\nㅤ\n[https://us04we
 b.zoom.us/j/495043928](https://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928)\nㅤ\nㅤ\n**B
 onus This Same Evening:**\nㅤ\nStick around after the event for **Steve F
 lemming Presents: Songs with Heart and Soul!**\nㅤ\nCanadian Folk\, Count
 ry and Adult Contemporary Artist\nㅤ\nAll songs written and produced by S
 teve Flemming\nDigitally Generated Vocals and Instrumentation\nㅤ\nTo hea
 r a sample of my songs\, check out my **Master Song Playlist:**\nㅤ\n[htt
 ps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLAUPCfNYb2LMMx2ORYqEzfXv7KX5WjrbF](htt
 ps://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLAUPCfNYb2LMMx2ORYqEzfXv7KX5WjrbF)
