SUMMARY:Steve Flemming Presents: Songs with Heart and Soul! (Meaningful Ev
 ents)  
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\nHello everyone\,\n
 ㅤ\nPlease join us for an inspiring and enjoyable experience with **Songs
  with Heart and Soul!**\nㅤ\nSongs about people\, love\, romance\, loss\,
  nature\, the past\, the present and the future\, spirituality and the sea
 rch for meaning in life :)\nㅤ\n**Do you appreciate:**\nㅤ\n• Thoughtf
 ul songwriting\n• Folk music\, country and soft rock storytelling\n• R
 eflections on life and meaningful lyrics\n• Songs that help you understa
 nd yourself and the world around you\nㅤ\nIf so\, you have come to the ri
 ght place :)\nㅤ\nThese are songs about ordinary people\, extraordinary m
 oments\, beautiful imagery and the search for what is real.\nㅤ\n\\*You a
 re welcome to join us any time starting at 9:30 PM (Eastern Time)\nㅤ\nEv
 ent details below:\nㅤㅤ\nSincerely\,\nㅤ\nSteve Flemming\n(Canadian Fo
 lk\, Country and Adult Contemporary Artist)\nㅤ\nㅤ\nCheck out my Master
  Song Playlist here:\n[https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLAUPCfNYb2LM
 Mx2ORYqEzfXv7KX5WjrbF](https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLAUPCfNYb2LM
 Mx2ORYqEzfXv7KX5WjrbF)\nㅤ\nㅤ\nEvent Details:\nㅤ\n**Steve Flemming Pr
 esents: Songs with Heart and Soul! (Meaningful Events)**\n(On Zoom)\nㅤ\n
 My songs explore the human experience through storytelling\, reflection\, 
 imagination and heartfelt observation.\nㅤ\nDrawing from folk\, country\,
  rock\, blue-eyed soul and singer-songwriter traditions\, my work touches 
 on themes of love\, loss\, hope\, resilience\, freedom\, social awareness\
 , personal growth\, spirituality and the search for meaning.\nㅤ\nMy song
 s often feature memorable characters\, everyday moments\, philosophical qu
 estions and a deep curiosity about life and human nature.\nㅤ\n**My songs
  feature:**\n• Memorable characters\n• Emotional honesty\n• Genuine 
 craftsmanship\nㅤ\n**Who is Steve Flemming?**\nㅤ\nSteve Flemming is a p
 rolific folk-country songwriter whose songs explore ordinary people\, grat
 itude\, personal reflection\, nature\, spirituality and the search for mea
 ning.\nㅤ\nHis songwriting also explores freedom\, awareness\, love\, con
 sciousness and the simple wisdom hidden in ordinary life.\nㅤ\n**Event Su
 pport:**\nㅤ\nHelp support these meaningful online events hosted by Steve
  Flemming.\nㅤ\nIf you wish to support these Thursday night online events
 \, which include more than three hours of music that I have written and pr
 oduced\, you can make a contribution by e-transfer or PayPal to:\n[stevefl
 emming11@gmail.com](mailto:steveflemming11@gmail.com)\nㅤ\nA suggested co
 ntribution of $5–$10 is appreciated for the event.\nㅤㅤ\nYou can also
  make a monthly online contribution\, with a suggested amount of $15–$20
  per month.\nㅤ\nAnything you can contribute is greatly appreciated and h
 elps support these wonderful\, intimate evenings among music lovers and fr
 iends.\nㅤ\nThanks again\, everyone!\nㅤ\nZoom link:\n[https://us04web.z
 oom.us/j/495043928](https://us04web.zoom.us/j/495043928)
