SUMMARY:Oakville Waterfront Walk\, Talk and Social! (September 20th) 
DESCRIPTION:Soul City Social Club (Toronto\, Canada)\n\\*\\*\\*Please kind
 ly read carefully\\*\\*\\*\n\nHello everyone\,\n\nCome join us for a beaut
 iful and relaxing afternoon by the lake as Soul City Social Club heads to 
 **Oakville for a Waterfront Walk\, Talk and Social!**\n\nWe’ll meet near
  the Oakville waterfront and begin with a few fun and easy ice-breaker gam
 es to help everyone get introduced and comfortable. From there\, we’ll h
 ead out for a leisurely walk along the waterfront\, enjoying the harbour\,
  Lake Ontario\, parks and some of the beautiful scenery Oakville has to of
 fer.\n\nThis is a social\, leisure walk. We’ll keep a comfortable pace\,
  stop along the way\, mix up the group and give everyone plenty of opportu
 nities to meet and talk with different people.\n\nThe area also has plenty
  of cafés\, restaurants and boutiques to explore\, along with beautiful t
 ree-lined streets and impressive heritage homes that add to the charm of t
 he walk.\n\nJoined by my other groups too\; so we can antiicapte a wonderf
